{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK by embedding XCFrameworks directly into your Xcode project."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Guides","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/NetworkTokenProvisioningGuide","doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/WalletExtensionsGuide","doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/SecurityGuide","doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/AdditionalResources"],"anchor":"Guides","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you cannot use Swift Package Manager, you can integrate the SDK by manually embedding the pre-built XCFrameworks into your project. This guide covers which frameworks to include, how to configure your project, and what to import in your code."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Download the SDK","anchor":"Download-the-SDK"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Obtain the SDK distribution package from Adyen. The package contains the following structure:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"text","code":["Build-IssuingSDK\/","├── XCFrameworks\/","│   ├── NetworkTokenProvisioning.xcframework","│   ├── IssuingCore.xcframework","│   └── IssuingCommon.xcframework","└── Documentation\/"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You also need the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdyenApplePayProvisioning"},{"type":"text","text":" SDK, available from "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Adyen\/adyen-apple-pay-provisioning-ios"},{"type":"text","text":". Download the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdyenApplePayProvisioning.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" (and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdyenApplePayExtensionProvisioning.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" if you use a Wallet Extension)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Required-Frameworks","text":"Required Frameworks","level":2},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Network-Token-Provisioning","text":"Network Token Provisioning","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All of the following frameworks are "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"required","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for Apple Wallet provisioning:"}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Framework","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Purpose","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Import in Code?","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NetworkTokenProvisioning.xcframework"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Provisioning logic and public API","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Yes","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCommon.xcframework"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Shared types (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TokenProviding"},{"text":", etc.)","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Yes","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCore.xcframework"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Internal secure communication","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"No","type":"text"}]}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdyenApplePayProvisioning.xcframework"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Apple Pay provisioning interface"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"No","type":"text"}],"typ